@api = http://localhost:5000

### Ca 1: Kiem tra may chu dang chay -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### Ca 2: Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Ca 3: Chi tiet mot bai tap ton tai -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Ca 4: Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### Ca 5: Bai tap sai kieu id (chu thay vi so) -> 404 (framework)
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/abc

### Ca 6: Nop bai hop le cho bai tap 1 -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### Ca 7: Doc lai luot nop vua tao theo id -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ca 8: Nop bai cho bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_NOT_FOUND)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/999/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV002",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv002/rest-api"
}

### Ca 9: Nop bai vao bai tap da dong -> 400 + ApiError (ASSIGNMENT_CLOSED)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/3/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV003",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv003/rest-api"
}

### Ca 10: Nop thieu du lieu (rong) -> 400 + ApiError (INVALID_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}

### Ca 11: Nop bai thieu Content-Type -> 415 Unsupported Media Type
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions

{
  "studentCode": "SV004",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv004/rest-api"
}

### Ca 12: Nop trung bai tap 1 cung SV001 (Mo rong Buoc 9) -> 409 Conflict (DUPLICATE_SUBMISSION)
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "SV001",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://example.com/sv001/rest-api"
}

### Ca 13: Xoa luot nop vua tao (Mo rong Buoc 9) -> 204 No Content
DELETE {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Ca 14: Doc lai luot nop da xoa -> 404 (SUBMISSION_NOT_FOUND)
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}
